flowchart TB
    Host[正式产品及Task Pack] --> Context[共享v4 Context Factory]
    Host --> Definitions[原Tool Descriptor目录]
    Context --> Request[Provider中立请求]
    Definitions --> Request
    Session[(原Session Tool身份)] --> History[原配对历史]
    History --> Request
    Request --> Alias[统一可读别名及反向目录]
    Alias --> Chat[Chat Adapter]
    Alias --> Anthropic[Anthropic Adapter]
    Chat --> Stream[原严格Provider流]
    Anthropic --> Stream
    Stream --> Native[原生Tool事件]
    Native --> Runtime[原Agent Runtime]
    Runtime --> Approval[原Schema Policy Approval]
    Approval --> Effect[实际受控执行]
    Effect --> Session
